<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Restoration Shaman Healer</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Head for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>The best head option available are the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a> googles, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59458/energized-bio-optic-killshades">
<img alt="Energized Bio-Optic Killshades" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Energized Bio-Optic Killshades</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58128/helm-of-the-inward-eye">
<img alt="Helm of the Inward Eye" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_dungeonmail_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of the Inward Eye</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56352/cowl-of-the-unseen-world">
<img alt="Cowl of the Unseen World" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_dungeonmail_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cowl of the Unseen World</span></a> or any of the normal versions of the heroic items listed are also great options.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
