<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Chest for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>The best chest option available is the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a> tier chest, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65244/tunic-of-the-raging-elements">
<img alt="Tunic of the Raging Elements" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_raidshaman_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tunic of the Raging Elements</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58126/vest-of-the-waking-dream">
<img alt="Vest of the Waking Dream" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_dungeonmail_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vest of the Waking Dream</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56274/chromis-chestpiece">
<img alt="Chromis Chestpiece" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_dungeonmail_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chromis Chestpiece</span></a> or any of the normal versions of the heroic items listed are also great options.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
