<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Hands for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>The best hands option available are the heroic <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63475/old-friends-gloves">
<img alt="Old Friend's Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_mail_dungeonmail_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Old Friend's Gloves</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58130/gleaning-gloves">
<img alt="Gleaning Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_mail_dungeonmail_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gleaning Gloves</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56383/ionic-gloves">
<img alt="Ionic Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_mail_dungeonmail_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ionic Gloves</span></a> or any of the normal versions of the heroic items listed are also great options.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74198/enchant-gloves-haste">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Haste</span></a> (when used to hit a breakpoint) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74255/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
