<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Waist for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>The best hands option available are the heroic <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63475/old-friends-gloves">
<img alt="Old Friend's Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_mail_dungeonmail_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Old Friend's Gloves</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62445/sash-of-prophecy">
