<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Feet for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>The best feet option available are the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62363/earthmenders-boots">
<img alt="Earthmender's Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidshaman_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthmender's Boots</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58481/boots-of-the-perilous-seas">
<img alt="Boots of the Perilous Seas" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidshaman_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of the Perilous Seas</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56448/dark-iron-chain-boots">
<img alt="Dark Iron Chain Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_mail_dungeonmail_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Iron Chain Boots</span></a> or any of the normal versions of the heroic items listed are also great options.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a>
