<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Restoration Shaman Healer</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Neck for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>There's an interesting dilemma here as the best neck, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67130/dorians-lost-necklace">
<img alt="Dorian's Lost Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_forestnecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dorian's Lost Necklace</span></a>, is a very rare world drop that will likely not be obtainable for the majority of players, but you can always farm the worse stats <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62416/yellow-smoke-pendant">
<img alt="Yellow Smoke Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea9.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Yellow Smoke Pendant</span></a> and come out nearly as well.<br/>
<br/>There is a very large amount of 346 jewelry available, so just remember that same item level gear is all roughly similar and as long as you get one of these you will be fine.<div class="pad"></div>
