<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Trinkets for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64645/tyrandes-favorite-doll">
<img alt="Tyrande's Favorite Doll" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_tyrandesfavoritedoll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tyrande's Favorite Doll</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62050/darkmoon-card-tsunami">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Tsunami" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_tsunamicard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Tsunami</span></a> are the best trinkets available, as the extra Spirit from Tsunami counts towards <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=16190/mana-tide-totem">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_summonwaterelemental.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mana Tide Totem</span></a> for a massive Mana boost to your whole raid. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68777/vibrant-alchemist-stone">
<img alt="Vibrant Alchemist Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_alchemiststonec.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vibrant Alchemist Stone</span></a> is also very strong if you have <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=171/alchemy">
<img alt="Alchemy" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_alchemy.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Alchemy</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>Unfortunately the on use effect of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58184/core-of-ripeness">
<img alt="Core of Ripeness" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cat_trinket04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Core of Ripeness</span></a> does <b>not</b> count towards <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=16190/mana-tide-totem">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_summonwaterelemental.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mana Tide Totem</span></a>, making it much worse than it would be otherwise.<div class="pad"></div>
