<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Restoration Shaman Healer</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="staff-weapons-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Staff Weapons for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>While you should not usually use staves, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59525/chelleys-staff-of-dark-mending">
<img alt="Chelley's Staff of Dark Mending" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stave_2h_grimbatolraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chelley's Staff of Dark Mending</span></a> can be acquired with just gold, and should be much cheaper later into the phase.<br/>
<br/>Also, if you happened to farm <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64489/staff-of-sorcerer-thane-thaurissan">
<img alt="Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staffofsorcerer_than-thaurissan.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan</span></a>, feel free to use it as it is a very strong option! <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64880/staff-of-ammunae">
<img alt="Staff of Ammunae" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staff-of-ammunrae.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Ammunae</span></a> occupies a similar place, but is likely to be rarer as it was not farmable in the Cataclysm pre-patch period.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74225/enchant-weapon-heartsong">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Heartsong</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74242/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Power Torrent</span></a>
