<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hands-for-restoration-shaman-healer">Off Hands for Restoration Shaman Healer</h4>While you can also use off-hands, we recommend using shields as the competition is lower and you will get free armor along with the usual throughput stats.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55070/elementium-stormshield">
